**/node_modules
.git

**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.nuxt
**/.output
**/.svelte-kit
**/.astro

**/.wrangler
**/.alchemy
**/.expo
**/.vercel
*.log

# Python virtualenvs, caches and build artefacts (the images build their own .venv;
# the host's is 700MB+ and would bloat the context and bust the COPY cache).
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
coverage
.coverage*
**/coverage.xml

# Local data and agent scratch files are never needed in an image.
ingest/
.omo
.sisyphus/
.scratch/

# Secrets stay out of image layers; runtime configuration is injected by the selected launcher.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Re-exclude node_modules, and KEEP THIS LAST: .dockerignore is last-match-wins. Re-including
# an example environment file can also re-include its parent directories, so dependency trees must
# be excluded again after that exception.
**/node_modules/**
**/.venv/**
